{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"GATE FAIL\n\n**A — Blocking.** C2 mistakes an exact reversal for unbounded uncertainty. In an R2 replay, booking and then fully reversing the same commitment gave $46.5B, or $28.5B without the disputed $18B, regardless of the commitment’s amount. C2 refused the calculation and asked for an estimate. Net additions and subtractions of the same figure ID before propagating bounds in both calculations. Keep R2m as the refusal control for two distinct bounded figures. [Bound propagation](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/calc_check.py:150) · [C2 refusal](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/calc_check.py:364)\n\n**B — Non-blocking.** No relabelling findings."}}
